cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "csd-lean4: a Lean 4 formalisation of Constraint-Surface Dynamics"
abstract: >-
  Machine-verified reconstruction of finite-dimensional quantum mechanics from a
  deterministic ontic surface carrying a Liouville measure and a
  measure-preserving flow, with the Born rule derived as a volume ratio.
type: software
